 100vw, 3200px","London, UK",[45,48],{"slug":46,"label":47},"workplace","Workplace",{"slug":49,"label":50},"exhibition","Exhibition","Interior design","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>A vibrant workspace born from an expressive client&rsquo;s spirit, with one or two original art pieces which always helps. A new HQ to build the Freud&rsquo;s community: Work, Show, Club.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[54,57,60],{"title":55,"copy":56},"The Challenge","\u003Cdiv data-slate-fragment=\"\">\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan data-metadata=\"&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiWGJVSFVxeUc3bjVjOHRLZjg4NzJVdyIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE3NDUwNDY2NjksImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)--&gt;\" style=\"caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>Design a work place that can showcase an art collection, whilst simultaneously accommodating blue chip and A-list clients alike.\u2028\u2028\u2028\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\u003C/div>",{"title":58,"copy":59},"The Strategy","\u003Cdiv data-slate-fragment=\"\">\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>More than just an office, build a community, and a dynamic space where work, art and socialising converge. Work, Show, Club\u2028\u2028\u2028.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\u003C/div>",{"title":61,"copy":62},"The Solution","\u003Cdiv data-slate-fragment=\"\">\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>A workspace that is more akin to a private members club with a bit of F#$% YOU. Bold, unapologetic and full of personality. A space that breaks the corporate mold, blending sophistication with edge. \u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\u003C/div>",[64,74,84],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":31,"videoUrl":32,"videoWidth":33,"image":65},{"width":66,"height":67,"url":68,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":69},2094,1178,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1739197267-8-dsc_0379.jp